                                "sense_id": "e9b140ac-f874-32d5-86f9-72b4378618ff",
                                "text": "But Tuesday night last gone in's garden-house / He knew me as a wife. As this is true, / Let me in safety raise me from my knees; / Or else for ever be confixed here, / A marble monument!"
